<title>USA: Triple P sees job cut benefits in late 97.</title>
<headline>Triple P sees job cut benefits in late 97.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Triple P said Monday it expects its restructuring program will contribute more significantly to its operating results in the second half of 1997.</p>
<p>The company said the first half of 1997 will continue to reflect operating costs associated with completion of the restructuring.</p>
<p>In November the company said it planned to cut 229 jobs or 17 percent of its employees. Information on how far the company has progressed in the cuts was not available.</p>
</text>
